Executed in order the following as instructed above:
Fix etcd/control plane (Problem 1) — nothing works until masters are 1/1.
Re-push any registry images with empty Entrypoint (Problem 2).
Delete the affected pods so they re-pull the corrected images: kubectl -n metallb-system delete pod --all and kubectl -n rook-ceph delete pod -l app=csi-rbdplugin (etc.).
Then re-run metallb.yml and rook-ceph.yml.

